1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:05,450
After the rain, water collects in places we forget to look.
Selepas hujan, air bertakung di tempat yang kita terlupa periksa.

2
00:00:06,050 --> 00:00:13,320
For a parent, a health officer and an analyst, the questions are different. The need is the same: know sooner.
Bagi ibu bapa, pegawai kesihatan dan penganalisis, soalannya berbeza. Keperluannya sama: tahu lebih awal.

3
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:18,310
This is Dengue Buster: a two-week outlook for every district in Malaysia.
Inilah Dengue Buster: unjuran dua minggu untuk setiap daerah di Malaysia.

4
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:25,810
Type where you are. See your district's risk, and what is happening within a few kilometres.
Taip lokasi anda. Lihat risiko daerah anda dan apa yang berlaku dalam lingkungan beberapa kilometer.

5
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,830
Then, simple steps that fit the risk level.
Kemudian, langkah mudah yang sesuai dengan tahap risiko.

6
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:43,480
Open the map. Switch layers: rain, density, schools, construction.
Buka peta. Tukar lapisan: hujan, kepadatan, sekolah, pembinaan.

7
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:53,090
Every estimate shows its reasons and its range, and who is most exposed.
Setiap anggaran memaparkan sebab dan julatnya, serta siapa yang paling terdedah.

8
00:00:54,250 --> 00:01:03,920
For field teams, a ranked list of schools, kindergartens and building sites. Priorities to inspect first, not findings about any site.
Bagi pasukan lapangan, senarai tersusun sekolah, tadika dan tapak pembinaan. Keutamaan untuk diperiksa dahulu, bukan dapatan tentang mana-mana tapak.

9
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:12,190
And for analysts, the evidence in the open: what predicts dengue, what does not, and how often the forecast missed.
Dan bagi penganalisis, bukti secara terbuka: apa yang meramal denggi, apa yang tidak, dan berapa kerap ramalan tersasar.

10
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:17,410
In English or Bahasa Malaysia. Light or dark.
Dalam Bahasa Inggeris atau Bahasa Malaysia. Cerah atau gelap.

11
00:01:18,850 --> 00:01:25,350
Built on open data, refreshed every day. District figures are estimates, so we show you the range.
Dibina atas data terbuka, dikemas kini setiap hari. Angka daerah ialah anggaran, jadi kami tunjukkan julatnya.

12
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:31,280
Check your surroundings. Clear standing water. Look out for each other.
Semak persekitaran anda. Bersihkan air bertakung. Saling menjaga.

